hint: The calls finish in the opposite order to the one they started in.
right: The calls pile up on the call stack, 2, then 1, then 0, and come off in reverse: 0, then 1, then 2. Last in, first out.
wrong: f(2) prints push 2 and calls f(1), which prints push 1 and calls f(0), which prints base and returns 0. f(1) returns 0 + 1 = 1 (pop 1 1), and f(2) returns 1 + 2 = 3 (pop 2 3).

